IT Support Technician – Level II (Remote)Position Overview

MobileIT LLC is seeking a motivated and experienced Level II IT Support Technician to join our growing remote support team. This position is ideal for an individual with strong technical troubleshooting skills, excellent communication abilities, and a passion for helping clients solve complex IT issues.

The Level II Technician will work remotely with end users, internal engineers, and client leadership teams to support a wide variety of technologies including Microsoft 365, servers, networking, cybersecurity solutions, cloud platforms, and business applications.

This is a fully remote position.

Schedule Availability

Monday – Friday
10:00 PM – 7:00 AM Eastern Time
Key Responsibilities

Provide advanced remote desktop and end-user technical support
Troubleshoot hardware, software, networking, and connectivity issues
Support Microsoft 365 environments including Exchange Online, Teams, SharePoint, and Entra ID
Manage and troubleshoot Windows desktop and server environments
Perform Windows Server and workstation updates/patching
Configure and support VPN connectivity, firewalls, switches, and wireless networks remotely
Assist with cybersecurity tools and remediation efforts
Perform remote workstation deployments, upgrades, and migrations
Escalate complex issues to senior engineering staff when needed
Create and maintain accurate technical documentation for client environments
Document tickets, resolutions, and technical procedures accurately
Participate in client projects and infrastructure upgrades
Maintain strong client communication and professionalism at all times
